      "bodyText": "Home Services\nCommercial Services\nAbout Us\nResources\nGet Started\nDelivery to :\n\n-----\n0\nEnter Zip Code Here\nContact Us\nSay hello (we’re really nice).\nCompany\nEmail*\nFirst name*\nLast name*\nCompany name\nPhone number\nState/Region*\nMessage\nAttachments\nStay Cool. No Sweat.\n\nThe easiest way to stay cool all summer long.\nAir Conditioner sales & rentals with delivery, installation and pick up!\nNow Serving Boston, Providence and New York!\n\nGet Started\nQUICK LINKS\nAbout Us\nPrivacy Policy\nReturn Policy & Guarantees\nCommercial Services\nHEAP Info\nNews & Press\nPartner Program\nFAQ\nSupport\nContact Us\nYour Privacy Choices\nLOCATIONS\nBoston\nProvidence\nNew York City\nUpper West Side\nUpper East Side\nLower East Side\nWest Village\nOther Locations\nCONTACT US\n\nPhone: (888) 762-6651\n\nEmail: info@RentAnAC.com\n\nFOLLOW US\n\nRentAnAC has been providing window air conditioner rental\nservices to thousands of happy customers since 2006\n\n© Copyright 2026 RentAnAC.com",
