      "bodyText": "Home Services\nCommercial Services\nAbout Us\nResources\nGet Started\nDelivery to :\n\n-----\n0\nEnter Zip Code Here\nAbout Us\nA Friendly Team That Rents, Sells & Installs Window AC's\n\nRentAnAC began in 2006 with the idea that for many, battling hot summers can be a bit overwhelming. Much of our real estate doesn’t offer central air, making a temporary cooling solution in the summer heat a must.\n\nAC units are heavy, annoying to store, and no fun to maintain. Starting with just a handful of air conditioners, an old van, and a bit of sweat we created a convenient service that promises to be a simple, start-to-finish cooling solution for anyone to enjoy.\n\nWe Want To Make You Happy\n\nWe strive to create convenience and offer a great service to our customers in every way we can. We’re passionate about keeping you cool are grateful for everyone’s loyalty and support. If there is anything we can do to make our service better for you, please don’t hesitate to send us a note.\n\nStay Cool. No Sweat.\n\nThe easiest way to stay cool all summer long.\nAir Conditioner sales & rentals with delivery, installation and pick up!\nNow Serving Boston, Providence and New York!\n\nGet Started\nQUICK LINKS\nAbout Us\nPrivacy Policy\nReturn Policy & Guarantees\nCommercial Services\nHEAP Info\nNews & Press\nPartner Program\nFAQ\nSupport\nContact Us\nYour Privacy Choices\nLOCATIONS\nBoston\nProvidence\nNew York City\nUpper West Side\nUpper East Side\nLower East Side\nWest Village\nOther Locations\nCONTACT US\n\nPhone: (888) 762-6651\n\nEmail: info@RentAnAC.com\n\nFOLLOW US\n\nRentAnAC has been providing window air conditioner rental\nservices to thousands of happy customers since 2006\n\n© Copyright 2026 RentAnAC.com",
